WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.449 --> 00:00:05.660
In many ways, life is like one big party.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:11.780
It is a gathering of energy and a celebration
of existence.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:19.040
The point of a party is to experience connection,
opportunity, and excitement.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:25.420
And the point of life itself is to fulfill
these same qualities.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:33.020
Like a party, life should stimulate an appreciation
of existence and collectivity.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.960
It should make us nervous and excited at the
same time.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:44.079
It should open us up to new people and new
experiences.

00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:50.970
Needless to say, everything we do in life
may not be as fun as a party, but if we approach

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:58.110
everything with the mindset that life is a
continuous effort to celebrate and connect

00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:05.390
with life itself, our perspectives and experiences
will begin to change.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:13.079
Things that would otherwise seem simple or
dull will start to elicit significance and

00:01:13.079 --> 00:01:14.880
wonder.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:22.939
One of our strongest desires is to feel perpetually
intoxicated by the substance of wonder.

00:01:22.939 --> 00:01:29.119
To look out the window of our bedroom and
see the same trees, the same street, and the

00:01:29.119 --> 00:01:36.999
same grass that we have seen a million times,
yet still feel amazed and inspired as if it

00:01:36.999 --> 00:01:40.500
was the first time seeing it.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:47.380
We want to constantly feel the sensation of
what our infant self felt when stepping into

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:54.539
consciousness for the first time, experiencing
the thrilling mystery of the relationship

00:01:54.539 --> 00:01:58.380
between human and nature.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:06.520
This desire is the reason why people do drugs,
drink alcohol, and party in the first place.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:12.670
To escape normal life and feel excitement
and stimulation.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:19.819
But if we view life as a party in itself,
we will constantly feel intoxicated by life’s

00:02:19.819 --> 00:02:25.159
wonder, and no longer feel the need to escape
it.

00:02:25.159 --> 00:02:31.879
We will no longer have to worry about the
feeling of waking up the morning after a party,

00:02:31.879 --> 00:02:59.209
upset that it has ended.

